    "text": "In 2008, their first year, Challenge Hiroba events gave out one card of their own: Piplup 119/DP-P, for every visitor from 12 July to 31 August, one of the 13 cards of that summer's Collection Challenge. In November 2008 players got, at random, an earlier Battle Road promo: Pikachu 025/DP-P or Gible 026/DP-P from Battle Road Spring 2007, or Dusknoir 094/DP-P from Battle Road Spring 2008, which had been cut short.",
